    "動態島與小膠囊": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Islands and the small capsule"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音樂、計時器等進行中的事，會顯示在瀏海旁的小膠囊。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Things in progress, like music or a timer, appear in small capsules beside the notch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游標移上去會膨脹，點一下就展開成大膠囊。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move the pointer over one and it swells; click it to open the large capsule."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "也可以用 ⌥Space 展開，←／→ 或 ⌘1…⌘9 切換分頁。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also open it with ⌥Space and switch tabs with ←/→ or ⌘1…⌘9."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在小膠囊或音樂頁上雙指左右滑動：往左下一首，往右上一首。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe left or right with two fingers on the small capsule or the music page: left for the next song, right for the previous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "換歌時，歌名與歌手會短暫浮現。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the song changes, its title and artist appear briefly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "展開後可以選 AirPlay 裝置、調整音量。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When expanded you can pick an AirPlay device and set the volume."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "待辦、日曆、計時器": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reminders, calendar, timer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "待辦事項讀寫系統「提醒事項」，向左滑可以刪除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reminders reads and writes the system Reminders app; swipe left to delete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "日曆顯示當天行程，左右滑動切換日期。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The calendar shows the day's events; swipe sideways to change the date."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "倒數與碼錶可以同時進行，結束時小膠囊會通知你。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A countdown and a stopwatch can run together; a small capsule tells you when they end."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把檔案拖到瀏海，會暫存一份複本，原檔不動。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag a file to the notch to keep a copy there; the original stays where it is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按空白鍵快速預覽，也能直接 AirDrop。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press Space for a quick look, or AirDrop it directly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有真的在拖檔案時才會自動打開。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It opens by itself only when you are really dragging files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "調整音量或亮度時，瀏海兩側會長出提示。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you change volume or brightness, an indicator grows on each side of the notch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圖示會隨音量與亮度變化。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The icon follows the volume and brightness."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要隱藏系統自己的提示，需要「輔助使用」權限。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
